{"id":153677,"date":"2026-02-27T11:05:28","date_gmt":"2026-02-27T11:05:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/?post_type=etablissement&#038;p=153677"},"modified":"2026-03-16T13:09:46","modified_gmt":"2026-03-16T13:09:46","slug":"fad-esebat","status":"publish","type":"etablissement","link":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/etablissement\/fad-esebat\/","title":{"rendered":"FAD ESEBAT"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>La FAD (Formation Assist\u00e9e \u00e0 Distance) d\u2019ESEBAT est une solution d\u2019apprentissage moderne permettant d\u2019acc\u00e9der \u00e0 une formation de qualit\u00e9 enti\u00e8rement en ligne. Bas\u00e9e sur des ressources num\u00e9riques interactives et un accompagnement p\u00e9dagogique assur\u00e9 par des formateurs qualifi\u00e9s, elle offre une exp\u00e9rience d\u2019apprentissage flexible et accessible.<\/p>\n<p>Con\u00e7ue pour r\u00e9pondre aux exigences acad\u00e9miques et professionnelles actuelles, la FAD ESEBAT propose des formations dans les domaines de l\u2019ing\u00e9nierie, de la technologie et des sciences, accessibles aux niveaux Licence 3 et Master.<\/p>\n<p>La FAD ESEBAT est une formation flexible et accessible qui permet de :<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Acc\u00e9der \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9ducation \u00e0 distance, sans contrainte g\u00e9ographique<\/li>\n<li>Apprendre \u00e0 son rythme selon ses disponibilit\u00e9s<\/li>\n<li>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficier de contenus p\u00e9dagogiques num\u00e9riques et interactifs<\/li>\n<li>Favoriser l\u2019apprentissage collaboratif et le partage d\u2019exp\u00e9riences<\/li>\n<li>Suivre une formation de qualit\u00e9 sans pr\u00e9sence physique obligatoire<\/li>\n<li>Des formations orient\u00e9es vers l\u2019avenir<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Les programmes couvrent plusieurs fili\u00e8res professionnelles :<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>G\u00e9nie civil et construction<\/li>\n<li>QHSE (Qualit\u00e9, Hygi\u00e8ne, S\u00e9curit\u00e9 et Environnement)<\/li>\n<li>\u00c9lectrom\u00e9canique et syst\u00e8mes automatis\u00e9s<\/li>\n<li>Hydraulique et assainissement<\/li>\n<li>Mines et g\u00e9ologie<\/li>\n<li>\u00c9nergies renouvelables<\/li>\n<li>\u00c9lectrotechnique<\/li>\n<li>G\u00e9om\u00e8tre topographe<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une approche p\u00e9dagogique innovante, la FAD ESEBAT combine autonomie, accompagnement et collaboration pour permettre le d\u00e9veloppement de comp\u00e9tences solides adapt\u00e9es aux besoins du march\u00e9 professionnel.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10917,"featured_media":153681,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","format":"standard","back-tax":[],"bourse":[],"domaine":[328,321,322,323,359],"localite":[418],"niveau":[347,285],"type-etablissement":[291],"type-de-cours":[213],"class_list":{"0":"post-153677","1":"etablissement","2":"type-etablissement","3":"status-publish","4":"format-standard","5":"has-post-thumbnail","7":"domaine-construction-et-genie-civil","8":"domaine-electricite-et-energie","9":"domaine-electronique-et-automatisation","10":"domaine-mecanique-et-techniques-apparentees","11":"domaine-sciences-de-la-terre","12":"localite-dakar","13":"niveau-licence","14":"niveau-master","15":"type-etablissement-etablissement-prive","16":"type-de-cours-formation-en-ligne"},"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement\/153677","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/etablissement"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/10917"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=153677"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement\/153677\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":159852,"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-